17727:The draw:handle-polar attribute specifies that a handle is a polar handle. The syntax for this attribute is the same as for the draw:handle-position 19.179 attribute. The first parameter specifies the horizontal center position, the vertical center position is specified by the second parameter. If this attribute is set, the draw:handle-range-x-minimum 19.183, draw:handle-range-x-maximum 19.182, draw:handle-range-y-minimum 19.185 and draw:handle-range-y-maximum 19.184 attributes are ignored, and the draw:handle-radius-range-minimum 19.181 and draw:handle-radius-range-maximum 19.180 attributes are used.
